{#
  Open Graph, Twitter card and meta description for the hand-written pages.

  Why this exists: until now NONE of these pages carried any of it. Sharing
  nycfintechwomen.com in LinkedIn, Slack or iMessage produced a bare link with
  no image, no title beyond the <title> tag and no description, and search
  results had no description either. Published FFF posts already had their own
  tags via lib/render-blocks.mjs; the static pages had nothing.

  Each page sets three values in its front matter:

    ogTitle   the headline on the share card. NOT the same as <title>: the
              <title> carries "— NYC Fintech Women" for the browser tab, which
              is wasted space on a card that already shows og:site_name.
    ogDesc    one or two sentences, ~160 characters. Also the page's meta
              description, so it is read by search engines as well.
    pagePath  the page's own filename, e.g. "become-a-member.html". The home
              page passes "".

  The card image is shared by every page deliberately. It is the brand card,
  built from the home hero — see tools/social-card.html, which is the source
  for src/images/og-default.jpg and explains how to regenerate it. A per-page
  image would be better for each page in isolation, but it is five images to
  keep in step with the brand rather than one, and the title and description
  already carry the per-page meaning.

  ORIGIN is written out here rather than read from a data file because
  lib/render-blocks.mjs:15 already hardcodes the same value as SITE_ORIGIN for
  the post pages. Two copies in two places is the existing situation; if the
  domain ever changes, both must change, and a grep for the origin finds both.
#}
<meta name="description" content="{{ ogDesc }}" />
<link rel="canonical" href="https://www.nycfintechwomen.com/{{ pagePath }}" />

<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
<meta property="og:site_name" content="NYC Fintech Women" />
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ ogTitle }}" />
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ ogDesc }}" />
<meta property="og:url" content="https://www.nycfintechwomen.com/{{ pagePath }}" />
<meta property="og:image" content="https://www.nycfintechwomen.com/images/og-default.jpg" />
<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
<meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
<meta property="og:image:alt" content="You belong at the table. Build it with us. NYC Fintech Women — 20,000+ women in fintech across New York, San Francisco and Chicago." />

<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
<meta name="twitter:title" content="{{ ogTitle }}" />
<meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ ogDesc }}" />
<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.nycfintechwomen.com/images/og-default.jpg" />
